OL,3,GNEWSAFour men released after extreme
OL,4,Aright-wing terror arrests
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour men who were arrested as part of a
OL,7,Fpolice investigation into extreme
OL,8,Fright-wing terrorism have been released
OL,9,Ffollowing questioning.
OL,11,FThe men, all in their 30s, were
OL,12,Fdetained under the Terrorism Act on
OL,13,FThursday.
OL,15,FThe arrests were made in the Balloo
OL,16,Farea of Bangor, the Mount area of east
OL,17,FBelfast and the Donegall Pass area of
OL,18,Fsouth Belfast.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,417,410,260,120,0,100
