OL,5,
OL,6,FDetectives from the Police Service of
OL,7,FNorthern Ireland's (PSNI) Terrorism
OL,8,FInvestigation Unit also searched
OL,9,Fproperties in Bangor and in north,
OL,10,Fsouth and east Belfast.
